[wifi] Reconnected to Redmi K60 Ultra at 192.168.x.y
[api] HTTP 200
```

### Build & Deploy
1. Update `include/secrets.h` with both SSID/password pairs
2. Rebuild via PlatformIO: `pio run -e esp32c3_supermini --target upload`
3. Open serial monitor on COM3 at 115200 baud
4. Observe boot log to confirm network selection

### Key Architectural Properties

| Aspect | Behavior |
|--------|----------|
| **Priority** | Mobile hotspot addAP() first; WiFiMulti scans in order |
| **RSSI tie-break** | WiFiMulti.run() selects highest RSSI if both visible |
| **Fallback** | Automatic if mobile unavailable; firmware tries stationary |
| **Reconnect** | WiFi.setAutoReconnect(true) handles OS-level drops; wifiMulti.run() recovers multi-network losses |
| **Boot timeout** | 12s max (unchanged); status logged to COM3 |
| **Offline mode** | Graceful standby with offline quote if both fail |

